## Decisions beyond the plan

- Kept the dangerous-character regex to only trigger on the **first** character (`^[...]`), per the requirement that a field *starts with* those characters.
- Added the existing quoting tests for comma/double-quote/newline so the untouched behavior is pinned while I was at it.

